# Tailwind v4

- Global styles: `src/index.css` with `@import 'tailwindcss'`
- Fonts (self-hosted in `public/fonts/`):
  - `font-general` — General Sans (400 Regular, 500 Medium)
  - `font-satoshi` — Satoshi Regular
- Nav links: `.nav-link` — 13px, medium, 0.5px tracking, uppercase, 12px padding
